        `нутритивное`

        $$\frac{"{"}\ce{"{"}C{"{"}18:1{"}"}(\omega-9){"}"} + \sum \ce{"{"}PUFA{"}"}{"}"}{"{"}\ce{"{"}C{"{"}12:0{"}"}{"}"} + \ce{"{"}C{"{"}14:0{"}"}{"}"} + \ce{"{"}C{"{"}16:0{"}"}{"}"}{"}"}$$

